{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pulls/326","id":2626812330,"node_id":"PR_kwDOKDql7s6ckfmq","html_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pull/326","diff_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pull/326.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pull/326.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/326","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pulls/326/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pulls/326/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/326/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/statuses/f5b386be8d575ac71b2c29262c13c87ab714a132","number":326,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix camera image URL retrieval on iOS and bump dependencies","user":{"login":"the-best-is-best","id":72160249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMTYwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72160249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best","html_url":"https://github.com/the-best-is-best","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This commit addresses an issue on iOS where the camera picker was attempting to retrieve the image URL using `UIImagePickerControllerMediaURL`, which is intended for videos. This has been corrected to retrieve the original image using `UIImagePickerControllerOriginalImage`, save it to a temporary file, and then provide the URL of this temporary file.\r\n\r\nThis change also ensures the picker delegate is strongly referenced to prevent premature deallocation and presents the picker controller on the main thread. Additionally, it falls back to the photo library if the camera is not available (e.g., on a simulator).\r\n\r\nThe sample app has been updated to display the retrieved image path.\r\n\r\nThe following dependencies have also been updated:\r\n- Android Gradle Plugin (AGP) from 8.7.3 to 8.10.1\r\n- Kotlin from 2.1.21 to 2.2.0\r\n- Compose from 1.8.1 to 1.8.2\r\n- Android compile SDK from 35 to 36\r\n- Compose Navigation from 2.9.0-beta02 to 2.9.0-beta03","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-06-29T09:34:48Z","updated_at":"2025-11-01T07:16:59Z","closed_at":"2025-11-01T07:16:59Z","merged_at":"2025-11-01T07:16:59Z","merge_commit_sha":"4daf4de1f4db5c5b68ea9767f926e46292e9b701","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"the-best-is-best:main","ref":"main","repo":{"id":940087658,"node_id":"R_kgDOOAiZag","name":"Calf","full_name":"the-best-is-best/Calf","owner":{"login":"the-best-is-best","id":72160249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMTYwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/72160249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best","html_url":"https://github.com/the-best-is-best","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/the-best-is-best/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.